From 8520eeac9cd9b4bdde65aad4412a9ce9db942ad7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 13:53:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Point legacy wp1 ad URLs at pages that exist.

osak.insbs.net/wp1/* was rewriting every slug under /osaka/, so final URLs such as /wp1/ibaraki and /wp1/siko landed on 404s. Exact rules now send those ads to the region page, WordPress page, or blog post that is actually published.
---
 public/legacy-ads/keishi-voice-1024x559.jpg | Bin 0 -> 109446 bytes
 public/legacy-ads/sheet.jpg                 | Bin 0 -> 6841 bytes
 redirects.config.json                       | 136 +++++++++++++++++++-
 scripts/verify-redirects.ts                 |  18 +++
 workers/legacy-redirects/src/index.ts       |  10 +-
 5 files changed, 162 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 public/legacy-ads/keishi-voice-1024x559.jpg
 create mode 100644 public/legacy-ads/sheet.jpg

diff --git a/public/legacy-ads/keishi-voice-1024x559.jpg b/public/legacy-ads/keishi-voice-1024x559.jpg
new file mode 100644
